  typical_uses: '[Jet engine turbine blade coatings,Rocket motor nozzles,Mass spectrometer filaments,High-temperature thermocouples,Petroleum reforming catalysts]',
  detailed_description: 'Rhenium is an extremely hard, dense refractory metal with the third-highest melting point of any element. HCP crystal structure with limited room-temperature ductility. Diamond grinding is mandatory due to the extreme hardness. Commonly examined in aerospace and high-temperature applications where rhenium is used as a coating or alloying addition.',
